                                                "sense_id": "8ac1e8e8-d656-3712-98e5-04054cdca0a6",
                                                "text": "As the text doth rise, I will touch and go a little in euery place, untill I come unto too much."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3121fc34-a88d-3bd7-ba52-236e88c3ffd3",
                                        "entry_id": "c9916b9a-c12a-3708-9586-e96716953e08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To touch bottom lightly and continue without damage, as a vessel in motion."
