                                                "sense_id": "3121fc34-a88d-3bd7-ba52-236e88c3ffd3",
                                                "text": "Whilst they were disputing the vessel touched the ground, but soon got off again.\n\"Ay,\" says the captain, \"he is a good pilot that can touch and go.\""
